#: docs/index.md:block 4 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"The Klipper firmware controls 3d-Printers. It combines the power of a general "
"purpose computer with one or more micro-controllers. See the [features "
"document](Features.md) for more information on why you should use the Klipper "
"software."
msgstr ""

#: docs/index.md:block 5 (paragraph)
msgid "Start by [installing Klipper software](Installation.md)."
msgstr ""

#: docs/index.md:block 6 (paragraph)
msgid ""
"Klipper software is Free Software. Read the [documentation](Overview.md), see "
"the [license](../COPYING), or [download](https://github.com/Klipper3d/Klipper)"
" the software. We depend on the generous support from our "
"[sponsors](Sponsors.md)."
